# The game is a single tracked file. It must never be ignored, and it must never have its
# line endings rewritten: depths.html is LF-only by design, and a CRLF pass would break the
# byte-level encoding the middle-dot canary depends on. core.autocrlf is off in this repo
# for the same reason.
*
!.gitignore
!depths.html

# scratch and build output
src/Depths.Core/bin/
src/Depths.Core/obj/
src/Depths.Tests/bin/
src/Depths.Tests/obj/
*.user
.vs/
.idea/
